{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43051","headline":"冬日与羣公泛舟焦山 一 · 王瓒","name":"冬日与羣公泛舟焦山 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江外水不冻，今年寒复迟。\n衆芳且未歇，近腊仍裌衣。\n载酒适我情，兴来趣渐微。\n方舟大川上，环酌对落晖。\n两片青石棱，波际无因依。\n三山安可到，欲到风引归。\n沧溟壮观多，心目豁暂时。\n况得穷日夕，乘槎何所之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王瓒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43051.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43051","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}